{"2923260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Silent Slayer: Vault of the Vampire", "steam_appid": 2923260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "Become a vampire slayer on a mythic quest to eliminate these powerful sleeping monsters  — an endeavor undertaken by only the bravest souls. In this jumpscare game with elements of horror and puzzle, you must destroy a clan of ancient vampires by carefully disarming their coffins’ defenses with the help of your guide — a mystical book. A pry bar, clippers, and a hook made from a finger bone are among the many tools within reach, but a stake through the heart is the only way to end it.<br><br>Tension builds as you cautiously lift bars, remove nails, and clip wires to find the vampire’s heart. Your silence and precision are key as you avoid awakening the beasts who will drain your life instantly. In this game, be prepared for:<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VICIOUS VAMPIRES</h2><br>Make one wrong move and you will have a royal court of deadly vampires on the attack.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923260/extras/e768c16ba97c45c1bc363c05c53b0f5b.poster.avif?t=1759932722\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923260/extras/e768c16ba97c45c1bc363c05c53b0f5b.webm?t=1759932722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923260/extras/e768c16ba97c45c1bc363c05c53b0f5b.mp4?t=1759932722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DIABOLICAL DEFENSES</h2><br>Untangle increasingly imposing and intricate traps ready to be tripped by an unsteady hand.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923260/extras/cd43a5e072cff868221d045afaf8c633.poster.avif?t=1759932722\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923260/extras/cd43a5e072cff868221d045afaf8c633.webm?t=1759932722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923260/extras/cd43a5e072cff868221d045afaf8c633.mp4?t=1759932722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TACTICAL TOOLS</h2><br>Master several unique instruments as you encounter increasingly difficult situations.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923260/extras/631b52cceebf9b86789c401855485d57.poster.avif?t=1759932722\" width=600 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923260/extras/631b52cceebf9b86789c401855485d57.webm?t=1759932722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923260/extras/631b52cceebf9b86789c401855485d57.mp4?t=1759932722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEVILISH DISCTRACTIONS</h2> <br>Maintain unwavering focus to conquer the unsettling diversions that will surely challenge even the strongest slayers.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923260/extras/ad650c0c67c875cd4f1c1a09340dfd1d.poster.avif?t=1759932722\" width=600 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923260/extras/ad650c0c67c875cd4f1c1a09340dfd1d.webm?t=1759932722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923260/extras/ad650c0c67c875cd4f1c1a09340dfd1d.mp4?t=1759932722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TWISTING TALE</h2> <br>Your story unfolds one coffin at a time. Heed the book’s advice, raise your stake, and do not miss.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923260/extras/446a441b5b75cfa8872b32bb0969f4cc.poster.avif?t=1759932722\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923260/extras/446a441b5b75cfa8872b32bb0969f4cc.webm?t=1759932722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923260/extras/446a441b5b75cfa8872b32bb0969f4cc.mp4?t=1759932722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Annihilate them, Slayer!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923260/extras/7f08b748da3f4f1998bfe812961ad37f.poster.avif?t=1759932722\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923260/extras/7f08b748da3f4f1998bfe812961ad37f.webm?t=1759932722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923260/extras/7f08b748da3f4f1998bfe812961ad37f.mp4?t=1759932722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>", "about_the_game": "Become a vampire slayer on a mythic quest to eliminate these powerful sleeping monsters  — an endeavor undertaken by only the bravest souls. In this jumpscare game with elements of horror and puzzle, you must destroy a clan of ancient vampires by carefully disarming their coffins’ defenses with the help of your guide — a mystical book. A pry bar, clippers, and a hook made from a finger bone are among the many tools within reach, but a stake through the heart is the only way to end it.<br><br>Tension builds as you cautiously lift bars, remove nails, and clip wires to find the vampire’s heart. Your silence and precision are key as you avoid awakening the beasts who will drain your life instantly. In this game, be prepared for:<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VICIOUS VAMPIRES</h2><br>Make one wrong move and you will have a royal court of deadly vampires on the attack.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923260/extras/e768c16ba97c45c1bc363c05c53b0f5b.poster.avif?t=1759932722\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923260/extras/e768c16ba97c45c1bc363c05c53b0f5b.webm?t=1759932722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923260/extras/e768c16ba97c45c1bc363c05c53b0f5b.mp4?t=1759932722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DIABOLICAL DEFENSES</h2><br>Untangle increasingly imposing and intricate traps ready to be tripped by an unsteady hand.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923260/extras/cd43a5e072cff868221d045afaf8c633.poster.avif?t=1759932722\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923260/extras/cd43a5e072cff868221d045afaf8c633.webm?t=1759932722\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923260/extras/cd43a5e072cff868221d045afaf8c633.mp4?t=1759932722\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TACTICAL TOOLS</h2><br>Master several unique instruments as you encounter increasingly difficult situations.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co